    "Helga Bloodaxe, the youngest but arguably strongest of the sisters, is a pillar of quiet strength. She has always followed in her older sisters' footsteps, honing her formidable physical power into a weapon against their enemies. Like Freya and Astrid, she harbors a deep-seated contempt for Christians, viewing them as a threat to their heritage and freedom. Helga is the defensive anchor of the Bloodaxe sisters, unwavering in her commitment to protecting her kin and their traditions. Though she speaks little, her loyalty and resolve are absolute."
